I'll be right back, Bua.

540
00:54:49,880 --> 00:54:52,880
APOMOD: What the hell? How delusional can a sasaeng even get?

541
00:54:53,440 --> 00:54:56,440
HANN4: I feel so bad for P Four. Honestly, the Sugars ditching him is all because of this person.

542
00:54:57,440 --> 00:55:00,440
4modact: What kind of love is this? Ruining P Four, ruining the SUGAR, I won't let this slide!

543
00:55:01,640 --> 00:55:04,640
KhunFour: Doesn't he realize how much damage he's done to P Four's reputation?

544
00:55:05,800 --> 00:55:08,800
HOON4MOD: Giving away 10 tickets to make up for doubting Fou4Mod!

545
00:55:42,200 --> 00:55:45,200
Holy shit.

546
00:57:40,760 --> 00:57:43,760
Tickets for Fou4Mod's fan meeting are completely sold out!

547
00:57:43,920 --> 00:57:45,240
Sold out!

548
00:57:45,240 --> 00:57:48,240
P Four's tickets are completely sold out!

549
00:58:47,520 --> 00:58:50,520
Chian sent this over...

550
00:59:14,560 --> 00:59:16,920
Whenever you miss me,

551
00:59:16,920 --> 00:59:18,840
grab this and cook it up, okay?

552
00:59:37,120 --> 00:59:41,080
The recipe...add water, turn the heat down low,

553
00:59:43,400 --> 00:59:46,400
just like softly kissing Little Four's cheek.

554
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:55,000
Wait until the longing bubbles up,

555
00:59:58,800 --> 01:00:01,800
Sprinkle in the RosDee Mala seasoning,

556
01:00:03,280 --> 01:00:06,280
wait until it melts away, just like Little Four's smile.

557
01:00:12,680 --> 01:00:15,680
Add the veggies, pack in as much love as there is for Little Four.

558
01:00:19,760 --> 01:00:22,760
Wait until it's cooked through,

559
01:00:26,440 --> 01:00:29,440
and wait until we can eat it together again.

560
01:01:12,200 --> 01:01:13,360
Ghosted?

561
01:01:13,360 --> 01:01:15,880
You're really not gonna keep our streak alive, huh?

562
01:01:15,880 --> 01:01:17,440
Can't even keep a simple streak going, what are you ever gonna accomplish in life?

563
01:01:17,440 --> 01:01:19,000
So damn irresponsible.

564
01:01:19,000 --> 01:01:20,440
Just send the streak fire already!

565
01:01:20,440 --> 01:01:21,360
Our baby's gonna die by midnight!

566
01:01:46,720 --> 01:01:48,400
Fine.

567
01:01:48,400 --> 01:01:51,720
We're over, then.

568
01:01:51,720 --> 01:01:53,480
Whatever you want!!!

569
01:02:03,360 --> 01:02:06,360
He's dying...

570
01:03:21,320 --> 01:03:26,120
And so, Bua and Baa, your dad,

571
01:03:26,120 --> 01:03:29,120
ended up breaking up.

572
01:03:32,240 --> 01:03:35,240
If they broke up over Daddy Fou4Mod before,

573
01:03:35,680 --> 01:03:38,680
who did they break up over this time?

574
01:03:42,800 --> 01:03:45,800
Come on, Daddy Chian,

575
01:03:46,440 --> 01:03:49,440
don't just cut it off like this.

576
01:03:52,400 --> 01:03:55,400
Chian, I'm back.

577
01:03:58,760 --> 01:03:59,320
Bua.

578
01:03:59,320 --> 01:04:00,520
Huh?

579
01:04:00,520 --> 01:04:03,520
Come talk to your kid.

580
01:04:03,600 --> 01:04:06,160
Oh.

581
01:04:06,160 --> 01:04:09,160
Baby.

582
01:04:14,080 --> 01:04:17,080
How've you been, kiddo?

583
01:04:19,320 --> 01:04:22,320
Good, Dad.

584
01:04:34,320 --> 01:04:37,320
I called Fou4Mod over to talk myself.

585
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:49,560
Hey, Chian.

586
01:04:49,560 --> 01:04:51,920
What's up, Bua?

587
01:04:51,920 --> 01:04:53,160
Baby.

588
01:04:53,160 --> 01:04:55,520
Hey.

589
01:04:55,520 --> 01:04:58,520
Baa.

590
01:04:59,440 --> 01:05:00,600
Come on, Baa, get over here.

591
01:05:00,600 --> 01:05:03,600
Baa, come here.

592
01:05:06,520 --> 01:05:09,520
Baa.

593
01:05:10,480 --> 01:05:12,200
Go clear things up with your kid.

594
01:05:12,200 --> 01:05:13,880
Baby asked Gelz to ask me so many times already.

595
01:05:14,200 --> 01:05:17,200
I'm so sick of answering.

596
01:05:20,840 --> 01:05:22,920
The two of you...

597
01:05:23,080 --> 01:05:26,080
Baby wants to know why you broke up.

598
01:05:33,520 --> 01:05:36,520
I really want to know why you broke up.

599
01:05:48,360 --> 01:05:51,360
Can't you just tell me?

600
01:06:05,720 --> 01:06:08,720
The breakup...

601
01:06:08,720 --> 01:06:11,720
was it because of me?

602
01:06:54,200 --> 01:06:57,200
Baa, I feel guilty.

603
01:06:57,840 --> 01:07:00,840
I'm sorry.

604
01:07:00,960 --> 01:07:03,960
So this means we have to part again?

605
01:07:12,120 --> 01:07:15,120
That's awesome! Go for it!

606
01:07:16,360 --> 01:07:18,160
I’d be so happy...

607
01:07:18,160 --> 01:07:21,120
if I got to see you as everyone's P Four...

608
01:07:21,120 --> 01:07:24,120
like this forever.
